# Seat 1 pons all three dragons and completes 567s and 88p with 7s.
# Seat 2 fed the third dragon, 7z, establishing pao. One Daisangen
# yakuman has base 8000; nondealer total 4 * 8000 = 32000.
# On tsumo, seat 2 pays all 32000 plus 3 * 100 honba.
# The nondealer win resets the one honba and rotates the dealer.

